                  <content>
                    <p>This Part operates concurrently with the power to make arrangements and grants of financial assistance under <ref href="#sec-32B">section 32B</ref> of the <i>Financial Framework (Supplementary Powers) Act 1997</i> or Chapter 2D of the <i>Social Security Act 1991</i>.</p>
                  </content>
                </quotedStructure>
                <content>
                  <p>substitute:</p>
                </content>
                <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__part-2__amdact-4__item-1__qstr-2" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                  <content>
                    <p>This Part operates concurrently with the power to make arrangements and grants of financial assistance under other laws of the Commonwealth including <ref href="#sec-32B">section 32B</ref> of the <i>Financial Framework (Supplementary Powers) Act 1997</i> and Chapter 2D of the <i>Social Security Act 1991</i>.</p>
                  </content>
                </quotedStructure>
